# Where each official streaming app lives in this repo (ADR-066): a
# service's id from the headings in service-hosts and service-names, then its
# app's folder. Inside its own folder, an app may name its service and reach
# its hosts. Everywhere else here, and in every other repo, they're refused.
# Only this repo has this file.
#
# SkyShowtime has no folder: it waits until it plays on Linux. Spotify has no
# heading at all, so it's refused everywhere.

disneyplus   apps/disneyplus/
netflix      apps/netflix/
primevideo   apps/primevideo/
hbomax       apps/hbomax/
youtube      apps/youtube/
youtubekids  apps/youtubekids/
